==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|frm|infestation}}, from {{der|en|LL.|infestatio}}.
Morphologically {{suffix|en|infest|ation|nocat=1}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnfɛsˈteɪʃən/}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪʃən}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The presence of a large number of [[pest]] organisms in an area or field, on the surface of a host or anything that might contact a host, or in the soil.

